    {
      "passage_id": "96598bb6-36ac-42f5-a6ab-ed9430c2d187",
      "slug": "detail-the-truth-about-bats",
      "library": "l2_skill",
      "source_body_markdown": "Few animals are as misunderstood as the bat. Many people imagine them as blind, dangerous\ncreatures, but most of this fear rests on myths rather than facts. Bats are the only\nmammals capable of true flight; other animals, such as flying squirrels, can only glide\nfrom tree to tree. A bat's wings are really changed hands, with a thin skin stretched\nbetween long fingers.\n\nThe most common myth is that bats are blind. In truth, bats are not blind at all, and\nmost can see quite well. To move around in the dark, many bats also send out sounds and\nlisten to the echoes that bounce back from objects around them. This ability is called\necholocation, and it lets a bat find a tiny insect in complete darkness.\n\nThere is also a myth that all bats drink blood. Across the world there are more than 1,400\nspecies of bat, and only three of these feed on blood — and those live in the Americas,\nnot near most of the human population. Most bats eat insects, while many others feed on\nfruit, nectar or pollen.\n\nFar from being harmful, bats help people in many quiet ways. Insect-eating bats eat huge\nnumbers of mosquitoes and crop pests every night. Fruit-eating bats help plants by\nspreading their seeds across the forest, while nectar-drinking bats pollinate flowers. A\nworld without bats would probably be noisier with insects and poorer in plants.",
      "expected_metadata": {
        "grammar_focus": [
          {
            "tip": "Cụm 'the only … capable of …' thường là điểm ra câu True/False ('the only mammals that are able to fly') — chú ý từ giới hạn 'only'.",
            "point": "Mệnh đề quan hệ rút gọn dạng V-ing (capable of … flying)",
            "review": "capable of + N / V-ing = có khả năng…; able to + V(bare) = có thể… Cụm tính từ có thể đứng sau danh từ để bổ nghĩa, lược 'that are'.",
            "example": "Bats are the only mammals **capable of** true flight.",
            "analysis": "Cụm tính từ 'capable of + N/V-ing' bổ nghĩa cho 'the only mammals', rút gọn từ mệnh đề quan hệ 'that are capable of…'. 'be capable of' = có khả năng làm gì, theo sau là danh từ ('true flight') hoặc V-ing."
          },
          {
            "tip": "'is called / is known as' báo hiệu một thuật ngữ sắp được nêu — chính là đáp án cho sentence completion ('echolocation').",
            "point": "Bị động hiện tại đơn để đặt tên/định nghĩa (is called)",
            "review": "Bị động: S + be + V3. 'be called + tên' = được gọi là…; thường lược 'by…' khi tác nhân không cần nêu.",
            "example": "This ability **is called** echolocation.",
