              },
              {
                "id": "p2-s2",
                "source": "Riverbanks lost the roots that once held the soil in place, while overgrazing also left bare ground that was easily washed away by spring floods.",
                "translation_vi": "Bờ sông mất rễ từng giữ đất, còn gặm quá mức để đất trơ dễ bị lũ xuân cuốn.",
                "precision": "sentence",
                "phrases": [
